      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01277",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“瞧你。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Look at you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01277",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "驹子还是高兴得笑眯眯的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Komako still smiled happily.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01277",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "然后，她把肩膀靠了过来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then she leaned her shoulder against him.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01277",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "“为什么不带我去？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why will you not take me with you?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01277",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "你变得冷淡了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You have grown cold toward me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01277",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "讨厌！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I hate it!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01277",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "报火警的钟声突然响了起来。",
      "en": [
        {
